#: includes/admin/class-protection.php:82
msgid "Default: warn only. Blocking uses the last published index; rescan after removing usage. Unsupported sources may be missing, so an empty index is not proof that deletion is safe."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-protection.php:82
msgid "Keep operation journals for days (1-365)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-protection.php:82
msgid "Expired journals are removed by the scan watchdog. Rollback becomes unavailable after removal. Journals store IDs, paths, hashes and statuses; no copied page content or personal field values."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-protection.php:82
msgid "Remove plugin tables and settings on uninstall. This permanently removes rollback history."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-protection.php:89
msgid "Media Dependency Map stores local indexes of attachment and consumer IDs, field paths, fingerprints and scan timestamps. User and comment field references can identify their associated WordPress records. Replacement journals record the administrator ID and changed attachment IDs. No telemetry or external service is used. Administrators control retention and uninstall cleanup."
msgstr ""

